            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid, no. It respects the case.\n\nRespecting 'ignorecase' and 'smartcase' options would have been a better approach indeed. But overall design of 'mini.jump2d' is planned to change (#1818) and it is planned for it to respect ignorecase/smartcase. So closing this in favor of #1818.",
